{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10103120","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10103120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1010312001:1":{"text":"フランツめ、やっぱり盗賊と手を組んでたんだな……オイラたちの調査を邪魔するなんて！","source_cn":"弗朗茨果然在和盗匪勾结……阻挠我们接近真相！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAFFA4503F24252A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1010312002:1":{"text":"色々手こずったが、収穫はあったみたいだな。","source_cn":"忙活了一大圈，总算是有些收获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC2D48B22AD2DD3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010312003:1":{"text":"みんな考えてることは同じだな？結論は明白だ。この火事はメイジとは関係ない。","source_cn":"大家想的都一样吧？结论已经很明确了，这场火灾与魔法师无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC7F2F3FCE2FDA0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010312004:1":{"text":"事件発生時、村には確かに火の元素が出現したが、火事の原因はそいつらじゃない。誰かがその前に松明で火を付けたんだ。","source_cn":"事发时，村子里虽然出现了火元素，但火元素并非引发火灾的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D3700360969DBAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010312005:1":{"text":"本当の犯人は、俺たちが南村で見かけたあいつら……フランツの部下たちだ。","source_cn":"而真正的凶手，是我们在南村见过的那群人——弗朗茨的手下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60E9B32DC07BCBE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010312006:1":{"text":"あいつらは村人に変装して忍び込み、松明で積まれた麦に火を付けた。","source_cn":"他们伪装成村民，混入这里，一把火烧着了小麦堆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40B943815E3C392A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010312007:1":{"text":"フランツめ、ただでさえ気温が下がって収穫が減っているのに……麦を燃やしたら村人の生活はどうなる！？\n麦は村人たちの唯一の収入源なんだぞ！","source_cn":"气候寒冷，收成本就不好……弗朗茨命人烧了那些麦子，村民...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x271347A8095E8ADF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010312008:1":{"text":"北村の農民たちにブドウを植えさせたいがために、こんな汚い手を使うなんて！","source_cn":"为了让北村的农户种葡萄，那个人竟然用这么肮脏的手段逼村...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C167DA00C40235D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1010312008":{"text":"北村の農民たちにブドウを植えさせたいがために、こんな汚い手を使うなんて！","source_cn":"为了让北村的农户种葡萄，那个人竟然用这么肮脏的手段逼村民就范！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C167DA00C40235D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010312009:1":{"text":"すべての手がかりがフランツを指しているが、今はまだけりを付ける時じゃない。","source_cn":"虽然现在一切都指向弗朗茨，但我觉得，还不能收网。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62F2325A1567DE52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010312010:1":{"text":"あのブドウがいったい何なのか、明らかにする必要がある。","source_cn":"我们得弄清楚，那些葡萄究竟是什么鬼东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x804D87C3D5EAAF7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010312014:1":{"text":"それに関して、初期分析を行いました。皆さん、聞いていただけますか？","source_cn":"关于这件事，我有个初步分析，请大家听一听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA284E328F545CBEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010312015:1":{"text":"北村の魔力は清らかな泉のように澄んでいて、\n一方、南村の魔力は沼地のように濁っています。","source_cn":"北村的魔力如清泉般洁净，\\n反观南村的魔力，则如沼泽般...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x115906A39A74B536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010312016:1":{"text":"そして、両者の大きな違いは、作物です。","source_cn":"两地最大的不同，在于作物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2234E6AF63ABA9D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1010312017:1":{"text":"私の推測ですが……魔力を汚染しているのはブドウだと思うんです。","source_cn":"我怀疑……是那些葡萄污染了当地的魔力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x244D861E3815A3F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1010312018:1":{"text":"それを検証するために、南村に戻ってサンプルを採取してきます。","source_cn":"为了验证我的猜测，我打算回南村取样调查。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB3BF8689B36A1B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1010312019:1":{"text":"どうやって？ブドウはフランツが厳しく管理しているのでしょう？","source_cn":"你要怎么取样呢，那些葡萄，弗朗茨不是管得很严吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA86D942BA8D1E856","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1010312020:1":{"text":"もしかして……","source_cn":"难不成……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC94CA268694AC56B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1010312021:1":{"text":"メイジのお嬢さん、あなた……盗むつもりですね？","source_cn":"魔法师小姐，你打算……偷？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A3B9F7F6196248A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1010312022:1":{"text":"研究者の仕事を盗みだなんてとんでもない！これも真相に近づくためです。","source_cn":"研究者的工作，怎么能叫偷呢？这是为了接近真相。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21B089893BCA9CD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1010312023:1":{"text":"ほんの一粒でいいんですから。誰にもバレませんよ！","source_cn":"我只需要一颗小小的葡萄就好，不会被任何人发现的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EECBA574E8F74A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1010312024:1":{"text":"ではお先に失礼しますね！デューラ様の祝福があらんことを！","source_cn":"那我先走一步，愿艾雅祝福你们！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x98C54DFA68BC91D8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ではお先に失礼しますね！デューラ様の祝福があらんことを！","female":"ではお先に失礼しますね！デューラ様の祝福があらんことを！","variant_male_record_index":"99140","variant_female_record_index":"99141","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1010312025:1":{"text":"みんな……話を遮って申し訳ないけど、オイラは先に失礼するよ。","source_cn":"各位……很抱歉打断你们，我得先走一步了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6416A4DE4846811D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1010312026:1":{"text":"急いで聖石町へ戻って、ホーガン将軍に捕まっているミレイルの無実を証明しなくちゃ。","source_cn":"我必须马上回圣石镇，米瑞尔还被霍根将军关押着，我得立刻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD18438B9123AB9E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1010312027:1":{"text":"なによりも、オイラが謝らなくちゃ。彼女が捕まったのも、オイラが犯人だと決めつけたからだ。フランツこそが黒幕だったのに……","source_cn":"更重要的是，我要亲自向她道歉，她遭受的这一切，都怪我冤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F86A7DA806492FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1010312028:1":{"text":"ホーガン将軍も詳しい情報が知りたいだろうし、俺も一回聖石町に戻るよ。",